    "bridal-mehndi"). These should be overridden by section settings or blocks in the theme editor.
    A future architectural change should add dedicated blocks for hotspot configuration instead of
    relying on these fallback handles. The JS runtime should validate that each targetCollection
    handle resolves to an actual collection before rendering the hotspot.
  {%- endcomment -%}
